{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19a50f0c56ecb7dfdf4cb4bec881a03193907ee496b11a4aacfa62e2cab38f3f", "ja": "（お姉さんを見送りに来た海美を迎えに、空港に来た。\nお姉さんを乗せた飛行機が、空へと飛び立っていく）", "zh": "（我来到机场接海美，顺便为姐姐送行。\n载着姐姐的飞机朝着天空飞去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "084bea5c6b7ae58a31a02230da5ea2d87504ed56238d5bb1e5dfcab165b30559", "ja": "はぁ……。\nあーあ、行っちゃったな～……。", "zh": "哈啊……  \n唉，已经飞走了啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "1db6b127f99c5c0d37100109006b228863dbf26e7c09a2a4025b25ec71e1ac07", "ja": "{$P$}、\n空港まで迎えに来てくれてありがとね。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你来机场接我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1678d99b35328f965a7be1ed4c827ceccafcfcbfcada26063197bb49354b707a", "ja": "いや、ついでだから構わないよ。それより海美、\nこのまま移動してすぐ仕事だけど……大丈夫か？", "zh": "不是，正好顺路，没关系。比起这个，海美，接下来马上就要赶去工作了……你还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "5be9684dab043f3c2192a5f26509ccbe99f37e4bd28767483ebd6a2dea3a1655", "ja": "うん、大丈夫！　ちょっとさみしいけど、\nちゃんと顔見てお別れできたし。", "zh": "嗯，没关系！虽然有点寂寞，\n但也好好见了最后一面，和她道别了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "e829f44fe218482b7ddaeefd54ac70746bb18914233b66abd4c8fa6567b2c31d", "ja": "お姉ちゃん、やっと帰ってきたと思ったら、\nあっという間にまた行っちゃったなぁ……。", "zh": "姐姐，我还以为你终于回来了，没想到转眼间又走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "d36533fe8ee132e2c074204d5eafbb0e76579992c974c4d240b98af7c5c2e141", "ja": "久しぶりに会えたのに、ゆっくり話す時間もなかった。\n私、話したいことがいっぱいあったのに！", "zh": "明明好不容易见到了，却连好好聊会儿的时间都没有。明明我还有好多话想说呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e2a7d2d0c473d72244960b6ea193eab9dcb2d2eaf19e4e9ec63f32a58b11f77d", "ja": "海美もレッスンがあったけど、\nお姉さんは更に忙しそうだったしな……。", "zh": "海美也有练习，不过姐姐看起来更忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "790d6ce4805b78055a74044b886860f50670a6f959ecebb730b68ebdac6fd766", "ja": "そうだね。でもみんなと一緒に、お姉ちゃんの\nバレエ観に行けたし。私のライブも観てもらえたし！", "zh": "是啊。不过我还和大家一起去看了姐姐的芭蕾，也让姐姐来看了我的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "986a458bdf49766358a9832906373b750777f7ef8648435081c9b65883e68a63", "ja": "だから大丈夫！\n全然問題ないよ、{$P$}。", "zh": "所以没关系！\n完全没问题，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6d6afdc270bfc4a88d5923eaf612c391b39dafa50976d6c0615192f9ffd0469e", "ja": "はは、そうか。\n今日は、どんな事を話したんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n今天聊了些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "f6e021a7cba4c54d9085239ad561eb487084c7ecd65dc6a8853e8adc41030137", "ja": "うん。お姉ちゃん、「海美ちゃんはもう大丈夫だね」\nって……「自分の夢を叶えていってるんだね」だって☆", "zh": "嗯。姐姐说：“海美已经没事了呢……”\n“正在逐渐实现自己的梦想呢”☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "5bea45f953dfb40e24860e54229b0d2be5458fe24eb945d39ac285d9622d622b", "ja": "あと「ターンの時、軸がぶれてた」って言われた……。\nまだまだ、お姉ちゃんにはかなわないかも。", "zh": "还有，她还说我“转身的时候重心不稳”……。\n看来我还远远比不上姐姐啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1013_p", "source_sha256": "961857744f159cecf9058bb6fabd39a3aa916bb30e5c0113448381ae09a9ef78", "ja": "そ、そうか……。海美のお姉さんは、\n案外スパルタなんだな。いや、体育会系か……？", "zh": "这、这样啊……海美的姐姐，意外地还挺斯巴达式的。或者说，是体育系的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "bf5e9b44a3ba0c9dc126f19cae7973b7c232e604713cf6a7b829eb98c6737a74", "ja": "えへへ、私のお姉ちゃんだからね！\nだから私も、負けないようにがんばらないと！", "zh": "嘿嘿，毕竟是我的姐姐嘛！\n所以我也得努力，不能输给她！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "08e2d7412553eca66e6557ef7e695f5f32123e58383df2a8770bb011127d73a0", "ja": "それで絶対トップアイドルになって、\nいつか、お姉ちゃんと共演してみせるっ！", "zh": "然后，我一定要成为顶级偶像，\n总有一天要和姐姐同台演出给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1016_p", "source_sha256": "68b6c56e7a9406f29af9d992778a3424f8479f0c729706e0bd8f0d1e326795e7", "ja": "おお、それはいい目標だな。バレリーナとアイドル、\n美人姉妹の共演……うん、話題になりそうだ！", "zh": "哦，那真是个不错的目标。芭蕾舞演员和偶像，美人姐妹同台演出……嗯，肯定会成为话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "db5c2b97227d4ac8fbe1f20e0334bc67b9d88c00015eab3b58dcb4c88fe6c70d", "ja": "ホント！？　じゃあその時も、プロデュース\nよろしくね、{$P$}！", "zh": "真的吗！？那到时候也拜托你制作啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "342489f2b91b5328cc89fcb8fc4eb8fceb752208557796abc418a9cd51c11001", "ja": "けど、何で共演したらお姉ちゃんに勝てるかな～？\n腹筋……いや、背筋……う～ん……。", "zh": "可是，要在什么方面合作才能赢过姐姐呢～？\n仰卧起坐……不，还是背肌……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0163_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0163_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0dbe021431fd55d575193983ec07f2db5a8b755faad03d26f694741608c04297", "ja": "いや……だからアイドルとバレリーナなのに、\nどうして筋肉勝負なんだ……？　まぁいいけど……。", "zh": "不对……明明是偶像和芭蕾舞演员，\n为什么要比肌肉啊……？不过也罢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
